sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Selected findings exchanged between a timeline and MISP
  accDescr: An analyst exports selected Timesketch or Plaso findings, imports them into MISP with source provenance, reviews the observations, and exports supported timestamped observations. Upload and access configuration remain separate actions in Timesketch.
  participant A as Analyst<br/>Investigation team
  participant T as Timeline tool<br/>Timesketch or Plaso
  participant M as MISP
  A->>T: Select a relevant time window and findings
  T-->>A: Export records with source IDs and time semantics
  A->>M: Import using timesketch_import
  M-->>A: Preview observations and retained provenance
  A->>M: Review and save the selected findings
  A->>M: Request timesketch_export for selected observations
  M-->>A: JSONL with activity times and MISP references
  Note over A,T: Review content and choose the destination audience
  A->>T: Upload through the normal timeline import
  T-->>A: Inspect ingestion results and possible duplicates
